WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.270
On one day in the month of Muharram, a
procession moves through central London.

2
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.740
Many wear black.

3
00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:09.230
Some beat their chests in rhythm.

4
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.590
Stalls hand out free
water to anyone passing.

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:18.440
On that very same day, many other Muslims
quietly keep a voluntary fast of thanks.

6
00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:23.490
So why do some Muslims fast with thanks,
while others mourn in the streets?

7
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:27.550
In this mission, you'll follow a small
group on a journey across the desert,

8
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.250
in the year 680.

9
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.960
Then you'll compare how Sunni
and Shi'a Muslims mark the day,

10
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:34.520
and why they differ.

11
00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:39.350
Your mission: find out why one day
means a fast of thanks to some Muslims,

12
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.830
and mourning to others.
